{"ref":"BDB, יְמָנִי","hw":"יְמָנִי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יְמָנִי</span></big>  <strong>adj. right hand, right</strong>—m. of pillar <span dir=\"rtl\">הָעַמּוּד הַיְמָנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:21\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.21\">1 K 7:21</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">הַיְמָנִי</span> in ‖ <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 3:17\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.3.17\">2 Ch 3:17</a> Qr (Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">הימיני</span>); f. of side of house (temple): <span dir=\"rtl\">כֶּתֶף הַבַּיִת הַיְמָנִית</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:8\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.8\">1 K 6:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:39\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.39\">7:39</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כֶּתֶף הבית מִיָּמִין</span>), <a data-ref=\"II Kings 11:11\" href=\"/II_Kings.11.11\">2 K 11:11</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַשְּׂמָאלִית</span>), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 47:1\" href=\"/Ezekiel.47.1\">Ez 47:1</a>, cf. v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 47:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.47.2\">2</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 4:10\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.4.10\">2 Ch 4:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 23:10\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.23.10\">23:10</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַשְּׂמָאלִית</span>); <strong>elsewhere</strong> of parts of body (P): <em>right ear, hand and foot</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">[ה]אזן הַימָנִית</span> + <span dir=\"rtl\">יד(ם) הַי׳</span> + <span dir=\"rtl\">רגל(ם) הַי׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:20\" href=\"/Exodus.29.20\">Ex 29:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 8:23\" href=\"/Leviticus.8.23\">Lv 8:23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 8:24\" href=\"/Leviticus.8.24\">24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:14\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.14\">14:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:17\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.17\">17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:25\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.25\">25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:28\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.28\">28</a>; <em>right finger</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶצְבָּעוֹ הַי׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:16\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.16\">14:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 14:27\" href=\"/Leviticus.14.27\">27</a>; cf. also <em>right side</em>, m. <span dir=\"rtl\">צִדְּךָ הַיְמָנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 4:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.4.6\">Ez 4:6</a> Qr (Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">הימיני</span>).","next":"BDB, יָמִין²","prev":"BDB, יָמַן"}